actual_result: "Both real nested CLI integration cases pass for project and global roots: authoritative baseline exists before CLI reads, copied settings validate with zero inherited items, genuine out-of-band drift fails, and original settings/history bytes remain unchanged. Fresh installed Node/Bun acceptance also passes."
